 "description": "Real-data test fixtures for the landslide_stability pipeline. chirps_cell_fixture.npz holds the verbatim CHIRPS v2.0 daily series of the 0.25-deg cell (lat_idx=249, lon_idx=1022; 12.375N 75.625E, Kerala, India) for the fixed climatology era 1981-2006 plus year 2018; glc_agol_excerpt.json holds the fields metadata and the first 80 features, verbatim, of AGOL page 0 of the NASA Global Landslide Catalog mirror; glc_event_kerala_2018.json is the catalog row of the 2018-08-17 Kerala mudslide (rain-triggered, 5 km accuracy) whose cell the CHIRPS fixture covers.",
